    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here SVRFFC The National Weather Service in Peachtree City has issued a * Severe Thunderstorm Warning for... Toombs County in southeastern Georgia... South central Emanuel County in east central Georgia... Eastern Treutlen County in east central Georgia... East central Wheeler County in central Georgia... Montgomery County in central Georgia... * Until 100 AM EDT. * At 1218 AM EDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line extending from Norristown to Aline, moving south at 45 mph. HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to roofs, siding, and trees. * Locations impacted include... Lyons, Mount Vernon, Vidalia, Uvalda, Oak Park, Ailey, Higgston, Santa Claus, Alston, Center, Toombs Central, Ohoopee, New Branch, Covena, Ponderosa, McNatt Falls, Kibbee, South Thompson, English Eddy, and Rock Springs.",
